// check_program()'s own block is full (mid/names/limits/shape/block/more/check.id),
// so its last action calls here instead of chk_dead() directly.
//
// The decomposition checks (docs/PROJECT.md, "Decomposition errors") run
// last: they read the whole parsed program, same as the checks above. Each is
// an error through diag: a generated parameter name (E0310, checks/genname/), a
// pure forwarder (E0406, checks/fwd/) and two functions that differ only in an
// imported value (E0405, checks/impdup/).
check_program_tail() {
  chk_dead();
  check_pure();
  check_program_tail2();
} return void;
given lz_empty given init_reg ():() then calls chk_dead:() then calls check_pure:() then calls check_program_tail2:()
given lz_o given init_reg ():() then calls chk_dead:() then calls check_pure:() then calls check_program_tail2:()

check_program_tail2() {
  check_genname();
  check_fwd();
  check_imp_dup();
} chain () {
  std_var_pass();
  ext_check();
  wsc_scan();
} return void;
given lz_empty given init_reg ():() then calls check_genname:() then calls check_fwd:() then calls check_imp_dup:()
given lz_o given init_reg ():() then calls check_genname:() then calls check_fwd:() then calls check_imp_dup:()
given lz_empty given init_reg ():() then calls std_var_pass:[1]
given lz_empty given init_reg ():() then calls ext_check:[1]
given lz_empty given init_reg ():() then calls wsc_scan:[1]
